---
/** Home "Designing Solutions that matter" heading + 4-up stats with count-up. */
---

<section class="section container">
  <div class="solutions__head reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="home.stats.eyebrow">Trusted Worldwide</p>
    <h2 class="solutions__title" data-i18n="home.stats.title">Designing Solutions<br />that matter.</h2>
    <p class="solutions__sub" data-i18n="home.stats.sub">Working with visionaries across industries.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="stats" data-stagger>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat__num"><span data-count="65">65</span>+</div>
      <p class="stat__desc" data-i18n="home.stats.desc1">Design, tech and communication solutions delivered to help organisations grow.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat__num"><span data-count="200">200</span>+</div>
      <p class="stat__desc" data-i18n="home.stats.desc2">Young people given practical skills and confidence through free workshops.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat__num"><span data-count="23">23</span>+</div>
      <p class="stat__desc" data-i18n="home.stats.desc3">Creative, measurable results delivered across sectors in our first year.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat__num"><span data-count="9" data-pad="true">09</span>+</div>
      <p class="stat__desc" data-i18n="home.stats.desc4">Emerging leaders mentored through fellowships to turn ideas into measurable impact.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
